ent-WH40KKasballicaFactionStorage = Kasballica Mission storage
    .desc = A persistent communal store for members of the Kasballica Mission. Contains 100 item slots.
ent-WH40KChartistFactionStorage = Chartist Fleet storage
    .desc = A persistent communal store for members of the Chartist Fleet. Contains 100 item slots.
wh40k-faction-storage-title = Faction storage
wh40k-faction-storage-rules = Each item or stack uses one slot. Bags and other storage items are prohibited, even when empty. Loaded weapons and battery slots are allowed. Deposit from your active hand; withdraw into a free hand. Using an item on the terminal fills the last free slot.
wh40k-faction-storage-capacity = Slots: { $used } / { $capacity }
wh40k-faction-storage-item-count = { $name } × { $count }
wh40k-faction-storage-empty = Empty
wh40k-faction-storage-deposit = Deposit
wh40k-faction-storage-withdraw = Withdraw
wh40k-faction-storage-refresh = Refresh
wh40k-faction-storage-busy = Storage is loading or processing a transfer. Please wait.
wh40k-faction-storage-denied = Only members of this faction can use its storage. You must be nearby and able to interact.
wh40k-faction-storage-full = All 100 slots are occupied.
wh40k-faction-storage-stale = This slot has changed. Refresh the list and try again.
wh40k-faction-storage-hold-item = Select an empty slot and hold the item in your active hand.
wh40k-faction-storage-item-rejected = This item cannot be stored. Storage containers, quest items and items pending another operation are not accepted.
wh40k-faction-storage-free-hand = You need a free hand that can hold this item.
wh40k-faction-storage-restore-failed = This item could not be restored. It remains in storage; contact an administrator.
wh40k-faction-storage-pending = The database has not confirmed the transfer. The item is locked until the result is reconciled automatically.
wh40k-faction-storage-deposited = Item deposited.
wh40k-faction-storage-withdrawn = Item withdrawn.
